===Etymology===
{{PIE word|en|tréyes}}
From {{der|en|fro|tribunal}}, from {{der|en|la|tribūnal||tribunal}}, from {{m|la|tribus||[[tribe]]}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/tɹaɪˈbjunəl/|/tɹəˈbjunəl/|a=GA}}
* {{IPA|en|/tɹaɪˈbjuːnəl/|/tɹɪˈbjuːnəl/|a=RP}}<!-- generated by [[Template:X2IPA]] -->
